#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:1
msgid "Upgrade notes"
msgstr "升级说明"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:3
msgid ""
"What an operator upgrading an existing deployment needs to know about "
"recent releases and their migrations. A new installation starts from an "
"empty database and can skip this page. The deployment order and rollback "
"are in [rolling deployment order](operations.md#rolling-deployment-order)"
" and [deployment reliability](deployment-reliability.md)."
msgstr ""
"运维人员升级现有部署时，需要了解的近期版本及其迁移的信息。新安装从空数据库开始，可以跳过本页。部署顺序和回滚见[滚动部署顺序](operations.md"
"#rolling-deployment-order)和[部署可靠性](deployment-reliability.md)。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:9
msgid "Before starting this release"
msgstr "启动本次发布之前"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:11
msgid ""
"Before starting this release, run `alembic upgrade head` through "
"`0120_operator_model_budgets`. The supported deployment scripts migrate "
"before replacing the API. Every migration here is additive and safe under"
" the running previous release unless it says otherwise; the few that need"
" stopped writers are in [applying migrations that are not backwards-"
"compatible](operations.md#applying-migrations-that-are-not-backwards-"
"compatible). After migrating, start the main control-plane listener with "
"its complete existing environment, so it imports newly registered "
"settings once ([Admin Settings](operations.md#admin-settings))."
msgstr ""
"启动本版本之前，运行 `alembic upgrade head`，直到 "
"`0120_operator_model_budgets`。受支持的部署脚本会在替换 API "
"之前执行迁移。除非另有说明，本页列出的每个迁移都只做增量修改，在上一版本运行期间执行是安全的；少数需要停止写入的迁移见[应用不向后兼容的迁移](operations.md"
"#applying-migrations-that-are-not-backwards-"
"compatible)。迁移完成后，用完整的现有环境启动控制平面的主监听器，让它把新注册的设置导入一次（[Admin "
"Settings](operations.md#admin-settings)）。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:21
msgid "One destination for every sandbox archive"
msgstr "所有沙箱归档只配一个位置"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:23
msgid ""
"**Archive to S3 and delete** now uses the **Sandbox archives** policy "
"under **Admin → Settings → Sandbox**, the one sandbox managers already "
"use: its bucket and region, the prefix `cloud-agent/sandbox/deletion`, "
"and its saved access key if it has one ([how](operations.md#sandbox-"
"archive-storage)). Its four own settings under **Admin → Settings → "
"Application → Sandbox archives** (`sandbox_archive.bucket`, `.region`, "
"`.endpoint` and `.prefix`) and their `AGENT_SANDBOX_ARCHIVE_S3_*` imports"
" are gone; the stored values are no longer read, and a later release "
"removes them. Before upgrading:"
msgstr ""
"**Archive to S3 and delete** 现在使用 **Admin → Settings → Sandbox** 下的 "
"**Sandbox archives** 策略，也就是 sandbox manager 已在使用的那一个：用它的存储桶和区域、前缀 `cloud-"
"agent/sandbox/deletion`，以及它保存的访问密钥（如果有）（[方法](operations.md#sandbox-"
"archive-storage)）。它原先在 **Admin → Settings → Application → Sandbox "
"archives** 下的四项设置（`sandbox_archive.bucket`、`.region`、`.endpoint` 和 "
"`.prefix`）及对应的 `AGENT_SANDBOX_ARCHIVE_S3_*` "
"导入已移除；已保存的值不再读取，后续版本会删除它们。升级前请注意："

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:32
msgid ""
"Deletion with an archive works only while the policy is enabled. "
"Otherwise an administrator can only discard a sandbox, and a deleted "
"chat's sandbox is retired without an archive. A deployment that archived "
"to its own bucket enables the policy first, with that bucket if it should"
" stay the destination."
msgstr "只有在策略启用时才能带归档删除。否则管理员只能直接丢弃沙箱，已删除对话的沙箱也会在不归档的情况下退役。原先归档到自有存储桶的部署要先启用该策略；如果仍想用那个存储桶，就在策略里填它。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:37
msgid ""
"There is no S3-compatible endpoint any more; the policy names an AWS "
"bucket."
msgstr "不再支持 S3 兼容端点；策略指定的是 AWS 存储桶。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:38
msgid ""
"With a saved access key the control plane needs no AWS credentials of its"
" own, so a Compose override that only supplied them "
"(`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_COMPOSE_OVERRIDE_FILE`) can go once this release "
"runs. The key needs `s3:PutObject` and `s3:GetObject` on `cloud-"
"agent/sandbox/deletion/*`, which the documented lifecycle grant on "
"`cloud-agent/sandbox/*` includes."
msgstr ""
"保存了访问密钥后，控制平面不需要自己的 AWS 凭据，所以只为提供这些凭据而存在的 Compose "
"覆盖文件（`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_COMPOSE_OVERRIDE_FILE`）在本版本运行后可以删除。该密钥需要对 "
"`cloud-agent/sandbox/deletion/*` 的 `s3:PutObject` 和 `s3:GetObject` "
"权限，文档中针对 `cloud-agent/sandbox/*` 的生命周期授权已包含这些权限。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:45
msgid ""
"Completed deletions keep their receipts, each with the full `s3://` "
"location it was verified at. A request not yet archived goes to the "
"policy's destination when it next runs."
msgstr "已完成的删除保留其回执，每份回执都记有验证时完整的 `s3://` 位置。尚未归档的请求会在下次运行时归档到策略指定的位置。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:49
msgid "Drain a host without `ADMIN_TOKEN`"
msgstr "不用 `ADMIN_TOKEN` 排空主机"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:51
msgid ""
"An orchestrator can drain a host with `python -m "
"cloud_agent.deployment.host_fence` in the control-plane container instead"
" of the admin API, without `ADMIN_TOKEN` ([how](deployment-reliability.md"
"#reaching-the-fence-without-a-credential)). The running control plane "
"answers the drain, so switch only once every control plane it drains "
"through runs this release. `ADMIN_TOKEN` can then go, unless you keep it "
"as the recovery door; without it, `python -m "
"cloud_agent.accounts.bootstrap_admin` in the same container restores an "
"administrator."
msgstr ""
"编排程序可以在控制平面容器中用 `python -m cloud_agent.deployment.host_fence` 排空主机，不必调用管理"
" API，也不需要 `ADMIN_TOKEN`（[方法](deployment-reliability.md#reaching-the-"
"fence-"
"without-a-credential)）。排空请求由正在运行的控制平面响应，所以要等它经由的每个控制平面都运行本版本后再切换。之后可以删除 "
"`ADMIN_TOKEN`，除非你想保留它作为恢复入口；没有它时，在同一容器中运行 `python -m "
"cloud_agent.accounts.bootstrap_admin` 可以恢复管理员。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:61
msgid "No `.env` needed"
msgstr "不再需要 `.env`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:63
msgid ""
"A control plane no longer needs a `.env`, and releases no longer ship "
"`deploy/control-plane/.env.example` or `deploy/host/.env.example`. The "
"database connection, the bundled database's password, the account key and"
" the settings root key live in the `agent-keys` Docker volume, kept by "
"the Compose `keys` service ([how](../../ENVIRONMENT.md#settings-and-"
"bootstrap-configuration)). A host's `.env` is written by Admin → Servers "
"→ **Add server**."
msgstr ""
"控制平面不再需要 `.env`，发布中也不再附带 `deploy/control-plane/.env.example` 或 "
"`deploy/host/.env.example`。数据库连接、内置数据库的密码、账号密钥和设置根密钥保存在 `agent-keys` "
"Docker 卷中，由 Compose 的 `keys` 服务管理（[方法](../../ENVIRONMENT.md#settings-and-"
"bootstrap-configuration)）。主机的 `.env` 由 Admin → Servers → **Add server** "
"写入。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:70
msgid ""
"An existing deployment keeps working. On its first start on this release,"
" the `keys` service stores the `.env` values of `AGENT_DATABASE_URL`, "
"`AGENT_POSTGRES_PASSWORD`, `AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`, "
"`AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY` and `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` in the volume,"
" and a value still in `.env` keeps winning. Keep those lines while a "
"rollback is possible: an earlier release reads them only from `.env`, and"
" its Compose file refuses to start without them. Before deleting them, "
"save the keys apart from the database ([Disaster recovery](disaster-"
"recovery.md)), because `docker compose down -v` deletes the volume. "
"`deploy.sh` no longer requires a `.env` or writes keys into one. A new "
"deployment's control plane also generates the sandbox manager credential "
"into its settings; an existing one keeps its own."
msgstr ""
"现有部署照常工作。它在本版本首次启动时，`keys` 服务会把 `.env` 中 "
"`AGENT_DATABASE_URL`、`AGENT_POSTGRES_PASSWORD`、`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`、`AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY`"
" 和 `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` 的值存入卷中，`.env` 中仍保留的值继续优先。只要还可能回滚，就保留这些行：旧版本只从 "
"`.env` 读取它们，没有它们时旧版本的 Compose 文件拒绝启动。删除之前，先把这些密钥与数据库分开保存（[灾难恢复](disaster-"
"recovery.md)），因为 `docker compose down -v` 会删除这个卷。`deploy.sh` 不再要求 "
"`.env`，也不再往里写密钥。新部署的控制平面还会把 sandbox manager 凭据生成到自己的设置中；现有部署保留原有的凭据。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:83
msgid ""
"The host build-time `*_EXTRA_VERSIONS` menus are gone: the sandbox image "
"carries only its reviewed pins, and other versions of Claude Code, Codex,"
" OpenCode and pi are installed from Admin → Settings → Agent versions. "
"Before upgrading a host, check its `.env` for "
"`CLAUDE_CODE_EXTRA_VERSIONS`, `CODEX_EXTRA_VERSIONS`, "
"`PI_EXTRA_VERSIONS`, `OPENCODE_EXTRA_VERSIONS` and `KILO_EXTRA_VERSIONS`."
" A version listed there that is selected in Admin or used by a retained "
"chat is not in the new image. Selecting it before the upgrade does not "
"help, because the old image still carries it and the update marks it "
"ready without downloading it. After deploying the new image, check in "
"Admin → Settings → Agent versions that every online host offers the "
"version, and run **Update** to it again where one does not. Until it "
"reports ready, new chats there run the default version, and chats that "
"need the old one cannot be forked. The lines are then ignored and can be "
"deleted."
msgstr ""
"主机构建时的 `*_EXTRA_VERSIONS` 版本菜单已移除：沙箱镜像只带经过审查的固定版本，Claude "
"Code、Codex、OpenCode 和 pi 的其他版本通过 Admin → Settings → Agent versions "
"安装。升级主机前，检查它的 `.env` 中是否有 "
"`CLAUDE_CODE_EXTRA_VERSIONS`、`CODEX_EXTRA_VERSIONS`、`PI_EXTRA_VERSIONS`、`OPENCODE_EXTRA_VERSIONS`"
" 和 `KILO_EXTRA_VERSIONS`。其中列出的版本，如果在 Admin "
"中被选用或被保留的对话使用，新镜像里就没有它。在升级前选用它也没用，因为旧镜像还带着它，更新会直接标记为就绪而不下载。部署新镜像后，在 Admin"
" → Settings → Agent versions 中检查每台在线主机都提供该版本，哪台没有，就对它再运行一次 "
"**Update**。在它报告就绪之前，那台主机上的新对话运行默认版本，需要旧版本的对话无法 Fork。之后这些行会被忽略，可以删除。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:97
msgid ""
"First-run setup also asks for the site address, prefilled from the page's"
" own address, and ends on Admin → Servers."
msgstr "首次运行设置还会询问站点地址（预填页面自身的地址），并在 Admin → Servers 结束。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:100
msgid "A deployment can provide models"
msgstr "部署可以自己提供模型"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:102
msgid ""
"An administrator can save a provider's endpoint and key once, under "
"**Admin → Settings → Models**, and every admitted owner runs on the "
"models the provider lists for that key, with no setup ([Provided "
"models](operations.md#provided-models)). The relay records each request's"
" tokens and their cost at the listed prices and limits nothing; the "
"provider's budget on the key does. Owners' own connections are unchanged,"
" and nothing changes for a deployment that adds no provided connection."
msgstr ""
"管理员可以在 **Admin → Settings → Models** "
"中一次性保存服务商的端点和密钥，每个获准的所有者无需任何配置，就能使用服务商为该密钥列出的模型（[Provided "
"models](operations.md#provided-models)）。中继记录每个请求的 token "
"数及按标价计算的费用，但不做任何限制；限制来自服务商对该密钥的预算。所有者自己的连接不受影响，不添加部署提供的连接的部署也没有任何变化。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:110
msgid ""
"`0118_operator_model_connections` only adds tables, and "
"`0120_operator_model_budgets` adds prices, budgets and recorded costs to "
"them. Builds between them let an administrator choose the models, a "
"default model, a daily budget per account, prices, caps on requests in "
"flight, an end-user header and per-account answers; none of that is read "
"any more. A connection saved on such a build keeps its model list, "
"verification and prices until it is saved again with a new key or Base "
"URL, or its models are read again, which replaces the list with the "
"key's. Its budgets, caps and per-account answers stay in the database, "
"unread, until a later revision drops them."
msgstr ""
"`0118_operator_model_connections` 只添加表，`0120_operator_model_budgets` "
"为这些表加上价格、预算和已记录的费用。介于两者之间的构建允许管理员选择模型、默认模型、每个账号的每日预算、价格、并发请求上限、终端用户请求头以及按账号的答复；这些现在都不再读取。在这类构建上保存的连接会保留其模型列表、验证结果和价格，直到用新的密钥或"
" Base URL "
"重新保存，或重新读取模型列表（这会用密钥对应的列表替换原列表）。它的预算、上限和按账号的答复留在数据库中，不再读取，直到后续版本删除。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:120
msgid ""
"The feature needs two services, which every stack now runs with no "
"profile: `model-relay` on the control plane and `model-tunnel` on each "
"host. Remove `model-relay` from `COMPOSE_PROFILES` if you added it. A "
"server that **Add server** sets up from this release gets its model "
"tunnel and `AGENT_SANDBOX_MODEL_RELAY_URL`. A server set up earlier, or "
"not by Add server, keeps working with an idle `model-tunnel` and gets no "
"turns on provided models until it is set up again. Roll hosts first, as "
"usual; a host on the previous release does not advertise `model-relay-v1`"
" and gets no such turns either."
msgstr ""
"这项功能需要两个服务，现在每套环境都会在不指定 profile 的情况下运行它们：控制平面上的 `model-relay` 和每台主机上的 "
"`model-tunnel`。如果你曾把 `model-relay` 加进 `COMPOSE_PROFILES`，请删掉。从本版本起由 **Add"
" server** 设置的服务器会得到自己的模型隧道和 `AGENT_SANDBOX_MODEL_RELAY_URL`。更早设置的服务器，或不是由"
" Add server 设置的服务器，照常工作，但 `model-tunnel` "
"处于空闲，在重新设置之前不会分到使用部署提供模型的轮次。照例先升级主机；运行上一版本的主机不会通告 `model-"
"relay-v1`，也不会分到这类轮次。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:130
msgid ""
"After a rollback, a host that Add server set up from this release still "
"names its model relay, but the previous release starts its `model-tunnel`"
" only with the `model-relay` profile: add the profile to that host's "
"`COMPOSE_PROFILES`, or its turns on provided models fail. Rolling back "
"needs no downgrade while no provided connection exists. Once one does, "
"delete it and let its conversations go first: the previous release cannot"
" read a turn that names one."
msgstr ""
"回滚后，从本版本起由 Add server 设置的主机仍会指定它的模型中继，但上一版本只在启用 `model-relay` profile "
"时才启动 `model-tunnel`：请把该 profile 加到这台主机的 `COMPOSE_PROFILES` "
"中，否则它上面使用部署提供模型的轮次会失败。没有部署提供的连接时，回滚不需要降级迁移。一旦有了，就要先删除它并放弃相关对话：上一版本无法读取引用了这种连接的轮次。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:137
msgid "Inference provisioning is withdrawn"
msgstr "推理账号开通功能已撤回"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:139
msgid ""
"The option to invite approved accounts to a connected inference service "
"(`accounts.inference_provisioning_*`, off by default, added one release "
"earlier) is removed. A deployment that wants its accounts on its own "
"models [provides them](#a-deployment-can-provide-models) instead; its key"
" stays in the control plane."
msgstr ""
"邀请已批准账号加入所连接推理服务的选项（`accounts.inference_provisioning_*`，默认关闭，上一个版本才加入）已移除。想让账号使用自己模型的部署，请改为[直接提供模型](#a"
"-deployment-can-provide-models)；其密钥留在控制平面。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:145
msgid ""
"The four settings and their `AGENT_LOCAL_INFERENCE_PROVISIONING_*` "
"variables are no longer read; remove the variables. "
"`0119_drop_account_provisioning` deletes the stored values, including the"
" dispatch token, and drops the two tables."
msgstr ""
"这四项设置及其 `AGENT_LOCAL_INFERENCE_PROVISIONING_*` "
"变量不再读取；请删除这些变量。`0119_drop_account_provisioning` 会删除已保存的值（包括分发令牌），并删除那两张表。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:149
msgid "`python -m cloud_agent.accounts.provision_backfill` is gone."
msgstr "`python -m cloud_agent.accounts.provision_backfill` 已移除。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:150
msgid ""
"Keys already issued at the inference service are not revoked by the "
"upgrade, and this service no longer revokes one when an account's access "
"ends. Revoke them there if they should stop working."
msgstr "推理服务上已发放的密钥不会因升级而撤销，账号访问结束时本服务也不再撤销密钥。如果它们应当失效，请到推理服务上撤销。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:153
msgid ""
"The audit log no longer records invitations or revocations; existing rows"
" still read as before."
msgstr "审计日志不再记录邀请或撤销；已有的行照旧可读。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:156
msgid "The bundled database is the one `AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` names"
msgstr "自带数据库就是 `AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` 指定的那个"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:158
msgid ""
"The bundled `postgres` service's healthcheck, pgAdmin's bundled server "
"and the documented backup, drain and undrain commands open the database "
"`AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` names (`cloudagent` by default). A deployment that "
"went through the [cutover](#independent-accounts-cutover) on the bundled "
"service by pointing `AGENT_DATABASE_URL` at a new database there, and "
"left `AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` unset, still has all of them on the archived "
"database: pgAdmin and `psql` show its old state, and the documented "
"backup dumps it. The `keys` service warns at every start while the two "
"differ. To fix it:"
msgstr ""
"内置 `postgres` 服务的健康检查、pgAdmin 内置的服务器，以及文档中的备份、排空和取消排空命令，打开的都是 "
"`AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` 指定的数据库（默认为 `cloudagent`）。如果某个部署在内置服务上完成[切换"
"](#independent-accounts-cutover)时，只是把 `AGENT_DATABASE_URL` "
"指向那里的新数据库，而没有设置 `AGENT_POSTGRES_DB`，那么上述这些仍然指向已归档的旧数据库：pgAdmin 和 `psql` "
"显示的是旧状态，文档中的备份导出的也是它。两者不一致时，`keys` 服务每次启动都会发出警告。修复方法："

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:167
msgid ""
"Set `AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` in `.env` to the database `AGENT_DATABASE_URL` "
"uses, and deploy. Postgres restarts with its healthcheck on that "
"database. Both databases stay, since `POSTGRES_DB` creates nothing in a "
"data directory that already holds one."
msgstr ""
"在 `.env` 中把 `AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` 设为 `AGENT_DATABASE_URL` "
"使用的数据库，然后部署。Postgres "
"重启后，健康检查指向该数据库。两个数据库都会保留，因为在已有数据库的数据目录中，`POSTGRES_DB` 不会创建任何东西。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:171
msgid ""
"In pgAdmin, edit the server it imported at its first setup and set its "
"maintenance database to the same name."
msgstr "在 pgAdmin 中编辑它首次设置时导入的服务器，把维护数据库设为同一个名称。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:173
msgid "Take a new backup. Every dump taken before step 1 is of the archive."
msgstr "重新做一次备份。第 1 步之前做的每一份转储，转储的都是归档数据库。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:174
msgid ""
"Optionally, rename the archive so nothing opens it by default, for "
"example `ALTER DATABASE cloudagent RENAME TO cloudagent_archive`, run "
"from another database with no session on the archive. Record the new name"
" with its dump and keys."
msgstr ""
"也可以给归档数据库改名，让任何东西都不会默认打开它，例如在另一个数据库中、且没有会话连接归档库时运行 `ALTER DATABASE "
"cloudagent RENAME TO cloudagent_archive`。把新名称与它的导出文件和密钥记录在一起。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:179
msgid "Postgres and the edge run pinned images"
msgstr "Postgres 和 edge 运行固定的镜像"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:181
msgid ""
"The control plane's Compose file now pins the bundled `postgres` image "
"and the optional `edge` image by version tag and multi-architecture index"
" digest, as it already pinned pgAdmin: "
"`postgres:16.16-alpine@sha256:0adbf25a…` and "
"`nginx:1.27.5-alpine@sha256:65645c7b…`. They were named by tag alone "
"(`postgres:16-alpine`, `nginx:1.27.5-alpine`), and artifact deployments "
"pull every image on each deploy, so a new upstream build could restart "
"Postgres on another minor version during an unrelated deploy. A new "
"Postgres or nginx now comes only with a release that changes the pin, and"
" this page says when."
msgstr ""
"控制平面的 Compose 文件现在按版本标签和多架构 index digest 固定内置的 `postgres` 镜像和可选的 `edge` "
"镜像，与 pgAdmin 早已采用的方式相同：`postgres:16.16-alpine@sha256:0adbf25a…` 和 "
"`nginx:1.27.5-alpine@sha256:65645c7b…`。它们以前只用标签指定（`postgres:16-alpine`、`nginx:1.27.5-alpine`），而产物部署每次都会重新拉取所有镜像，所以上游的新构建可能在一次无关的部署中把"
" Postgres 重启到另一个小版本。现在只有修改了固定版本的发布才会带来新的 Postgres 或 nginx，本页会注明。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:190
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The first deploy of this release recreates `postgres`, and `edge` where "
"its profile is enabled, once; Postgres is unavailable for the few seconds"
" of the restart. Check the running version first with `docker exec "
"\"${COMPOSE_PROJECT:?}-postgres-1\" postgres --version`: an earlier 16.x "
"moves up to 16.16, and a later 16.x moves back to it. A minor release "
"keeps the data format, so neither needs a dump or restore, but read the "
"PostgreSQL release notes in between for any steps they ask for. nginx "
"stays on 1.27.5, and pgAdmin's pin is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"本版本的首次部署会重新创建一次 `postgres`，在启用了相应 profile 的地方也会重建 `edge`；重启期间 Postgres "
"会有几秒不可用。先用 `docker exec \"${COMPOSE_PROJECT:?}-postgres-1\" postgres "
"--version` 查看当前版本：较早的 16.x 会升到 16.16，较新的 16.x 会退回到 "
"16.16。小版本保持数据格式不变，所以两种情况都不需要导出或恢复，但请阅读两个版本之间的 PostgreSQL "
"发布说明，看是否有需要执行的步骤。nginx 保持 1.27.5，pgAdmin 的固定版本不变。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:199
msgid "The audit log names who acted on whom"
msgstr "审计日志写明谁对谁做了什么"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:201
msgid ""
"**Admin → Audit log** names the administrator and the account of each "
"action, files account decisions under **Accounts**, and by default shows "
"only people: administrators' sessions and break-glass access "
"(`ADMIN_TOKEN`, first-run setup, the bootstrap command). Automation, the "
"control plane's own workers and policy, and accounts changing themselves "
"are one switch away. A request whose work runs later, such as a sandbox "
"deletion or a new server, shows its final result. Erasing an account no "
"longer deletes the audit rows about it, and an audit row that cannot be "
"written no longer fails the action it records; the page reports the miss "
"([reading the trail](operations.md#reading-a-tasks-recorded-events))."
msgstr ""
"**Admin → Audit log** 会写明每项操作的管理员和对象账号，把账号相关的决定归入 "
"**Accounts**，默认只显示人的操作：管理员的会话和应急访问（`ADMIN_TOKEN`、首次运行设置、bootstrap "
"命令）。自动化、控制平面自身的 worker "
"和策略，以及账号自行修改，切换一下开关就能看到。稍后才执行的请求（例如沙箱删除或新增服务器）会显示最终结果。清除账号不再删除与它有关的审计行；审计行写入失败也不再使它所记录的操作失败，页面会报告这次遗漏（[查看审计记录](operations.md#reading-a"
"-tasks-recorded-events)）。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:212
msgid "Agents open their own pull requests"
msgstr "Agent 自己开 pull request"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:214
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The platform no longer publishes workspaces: there is no **Create PR** or"
" **Update PR** button, no `POST /v1/agent/threads/{thread_id}/publish`, "
"no workspace snapshot and no `agent/<thread>` branch. When the owner "
"asks, the agent commits, pushes a branch and opens the pull request "
"itself, as the owner, through [the GitHub relay](operations.md#the-"
"github-relay); without the relay, agents cannot push. **Watch PR and "
"merge** has the agent use git and `gh api` REST calls. Follow-up turns "
"start from the conversation's own base. Pull requests the publisher "
"opened stay on GitHub as they are, and nothing pushes to their `agent/…` "
"branches again."
msgstr ""
"平台不再发布工作区：没有 **Create PR** 或 **Update PR** 按钮，没有 `POST "
"/v1/agent/threads/{thread_id}/publish`，没有工作区快照，也没有 `agent/<thread>` "
"分支。所有者提出要求时，agent 自己以所有者身份通过 [GitHub 中继](operations.md#the-github-"
"relay)提交、推送分支并开拉取请求；没有配置中继时，agent 无法推送。**Watch PR and merge** 让 agent "
"自己使用 git 和 `gh api` REST 调用。后续轮次总是从对话自己的基线开始。旧发布器开出的拉取请求原样留在 GitHub "
"上，不会再有任何东西推送到它们的 `agent/…` 分支。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:224
msgid ""
"The control plane no longer reads `AGENT_GITHUB_TOKEN`, "
"`AGENT_PUBLISH_BASE_BRANCH`, `AGENT_GIT_AUTHOR_NAME` or "
"`AGENT_GIT_AUTHOR_EMAIL`, and Admin → Settings has no Publication group; "
"delete those lines from the control plane's `.env`. Commits are authored "
"as the conversation's owner, with `AGENT_GITHUB_COAUTHOR` as co-author."
msgstr ""
"控制平面不再读取 "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_TOKEN`、`AGENT_PUBLISH_BASE_BRANCH`、`AGENT_GIT_AUTHOR_NAME` "
"或 `AGENT_GIT_AUTHOR_EMAIL`，Admin → Settings 中也没有 Publication 分组；请从控制平面的 "
"`.env` 中删除这些行。提交以对话所有者为作者，`AGENT_GITHUB_COAUTHOR` 为共同作者。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:230
msgid ""
"The publisher's tables (`agent_sandbox_snapshots`, `agent_snapshot_jobs`,"
" `agent_pr_archive_checks`) and `agent_jobs.published_commit_sha` stay, "
"unused, until a migration in the next release drops them. This release is"
" an ordinary rolling deploy, and rolling back needs no downgrade and "
"loses nothing."
msgstr ""
"发布器的表（`agent_sandbox_snapshots`、`agent_snapshot_jobs`、`agent_pr_archive_checks`）和"
" `agent_jobs.published_commit_sha` "
"仍然保留但不再使用，下一个版本的迁移会删除它们。本版本是一次普通的滚动部署，回滚不需要降级迁移，也不会丢失任何东西。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:235
msgid "MCP servers run in two places"
msgstr "MCP 服务器只在两个地方运行"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:237
msgid ""
"An MCP connection is an online service (`remote`) or a program in the "
"chat's sandbox (`sandbox`). The two locations nothing ever ran, `managed-"
"worker` and `user-connector`, are gone: the API refuses them, as it "
"refuses `connector_id`, and connection views no longer carry "
"`connector_id`. `0115_mcp_retire_dead_locations` moves any connection "
"stored at either to `sandbox`, with its command unchanged. It runs when "
"its command passes the sandbox's rules (`npx` or `uvx` and one exactly "
"pinned package, no mounts or working directory) and is left out of chats "
"otherwise; its owner can disconnect and add it again, or edit its command"
" through the API. To count such rows before upgrading:"
msgstr ""
"MCP 连接要么是在线服务（`remote`），要么是对话沙箱中的程序（`sandbox`）。从未运行过任何东西的两个位置 `managed-"
"worker` 和 `user-connector` 已移除：API 会拒绝它们，也会拒绝 `connector_id`，连接视图中也不再带 "
"`connector_id`。`0115_mcp_retire_dead_locations` 会把存储在这两个位置的连接移到 "
"`sandbox`，命令保持不变。命令符合沙箱规则（`npx` 或 `uvx` "
"加一个精确固定版本的包，没有挂载或工作目录）时它会运行，否则不会加入对话；所有者可以断开后重新添加，或通过 API "
"编辑命令。升级前可以这样统计这类行："

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:253
msgid ""
"The connector tables (`agent_mcp_connectors`, "
"`agent_mcp_connector_connections`) and "
"`agent_mcp_connections.connector_id` stay, unused, until a later release "
"drops them. During the rollout, the previous release refuses to store a "
"connection at a removed location. Rolling back needs no downgrade: the "
"previous release reads the moved rows as programs."
msgstr ""
"连接器相关的表（`agent_mcp_connectors`、`agent_mcp_connector_connections`）和 "
"`agent_mcp_connections.connector_id` "
"仍然保留但不再使用，后续版本会删除。滚动部署期间，上一版本会拒绝把连接存到已移除的位置。回滚不需要降级迁移：上一版本会把移动过的行当作程序读取。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:260
msgid "Shorter `.env` files"
msgstr "更短的 `.env` 文件"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:262
msgid ""
"The example `.env` files now hold only what Admin cannot manage: the "
"database connection, the root keys, the recovery token, container wiring,"
" and on a host its tunnels, identity and sandbox boundaries. Every other "
"value is set in Admin → Settings, or per server on the Servers page, and "
"a missing required setting is named at the top of the Admin pages."
msgstr ""
"示例 `.env` 文件现在只包含 Admin "
"无法管理的内容：数据库连接、根密钥、恢复令牌、容器连接配置，以及主机上的隧道、身份和沙箱边界。其他所有值都在 Admin → Settings "
"中设置，或在 Servers 页面按服务器设置；缺少必需设置时，Admin 页面顶部会指出。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:268
msgid ""
"An existing `.env` keeps working: the first start of a release that "
"registers a setting imports its value once, and from then on the database"
" wins. After the control plane or host has started once on this release, "
"these lines can be deleted:"
msgstr ""
"现有的 `.env` "
"照常工作：注册某项设置的版本首次启动时会导入一次它的值，此后以数据库为准。控制平面或主机在本版本上启动过一次之后，可以删除以下这些行："

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "Where"
msgstr "位置"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "Lines that can be deleted"
msgstr "可以删掉的行"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "Control plane"
msgstr "控制平面"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"`AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL`, `AGENT_SMTP_*`, `AGENT_LOCAL_ADMIN_EMAILS`, "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_ARCHIVE_S3_*`, `AGENT_MAX_STREAMS_PER_USER`, "
"`AGENT_API_DOCS`, `AGENT_RUNTIME_REGISTRY_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "Each host"
msgstr "每台主机"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"`AGENT_HOST_SLOTS`, `AGENT_SHARED_RESIDENT_CAPACITY`, "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_CPU_MILLICORES`, `AGENT_SANDBOX_MEMORY_MIB`, "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_DISK_MIB`, `AGENT_CHAT_IDLE_TIMEOUT_S`, "
"`AGENT_SOURCE_IMPORT_MAX_MIB`, `AGENT_LEASE_TTL`, "
"`AGENT_RUNTIME_REGISTRY_URL`, `AGENT_GIT_AUTHOR_NAME`, "
"`AGENT_GIT_AUTHOR_EMAIL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "A managed host's environment file in a deployment profile"
msgstr "部署配置里托管主机的环境文件"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`AGENT_HOST_SLOTS`, `AGENT_SHARED_RESIDENT_CAPACITY`"
msgstr "`AGENT_HOST_SLOTS`、`AGENT_SHARED_RESIDENT_CAPACITY`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:279
msgid ""
"`AGENT_COMPUTE_SECRET_KEY` is imported the same way: once stored, saved "
"compute credentials decrypt with the stored key, so the line can go too. "
"`deploy.sh` no longer writes one; a new control plane generates it into "
"its settings. Back up the settings root key "
"(`AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY`, or `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` where that is"
" the root) with the database. Keep `AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN` on each "
"host: it is the host's copy of the credential."
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_COMPUTE_SECRET_KEY` "
"也以同样方式导入：保存后，已存的计算资源凭据用保存的密钥解密，所以这一行也可以删除。`deploy.sh` "
"不再写入它；新的控制平面会把它生成到自己的设置中。设置根密钥（`AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY`，或以 "
"`AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` 为根时的该值）要和数据库一起备份。每台主机上保留 "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN`：那是主机自己持有的凭据副本。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:287
msgid ""
"`ADMIN_TOKEN` is optional: a new deployment's first administrator uses "
"the one-time setup code, and an existing deployment can keep the token as"
" its recovery door. `deploy.sh` now generates a new installation's "
"database password and DSN, account key and settings root key. It never "
"replaces a set value or adds a settings key beside "
"`AGENT_SESSION_SECRET`, and on a root that has deployed before it stops "
"and names any missing required value rather than generate one."
msgstr ""
"`ADMIN_TOKEN` 是可选的：新部署的第一个管理员使用一次性设置码，现有部署可以保留该令牌作为恢复入口。`deploy.sh` "
"现在会为新安装生成数据库密码和 DSN、账号密钥和设置根密钥。它从不替换已设置的值，也不会在 `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` "
"旁边再添加一个设置密钥；在曾经部署过的根目录上，缺少必需值时它会停下并指出缺少哪些，而不是自动生成。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:295
msgid ""
"The web app is now served only at the root of its own hostname, with the "
"API at `/api`; mounting it under a path such as `/agents` was removed, "
"and releases no longer carry the `web-agents` image. Delete "
"`AGENT_WEB_BASE_PATH`, `AGENT_WEB_API_URL` and `AGENT_DEPLOYMENT_SHA` "
"from the control plane's `.env` (`deploy.sh` exports the commit it "
"deploys). An empty `AGENT_WEB_BASE_PATH` is harmless; one with a value "
"stops `deploy.sh` and the release deployer. `AGENT_NETWORK_NAME` can go "
"too, unless another stack's reverse proxy joins the network by a name "
"other than `cloud-agent`. A distribution that resolves releases must "
"accept one without the `/agents` web image before deploying it."
msgstr ""
"Web 应用现在只部署在自己主机名的根路径，API 在 `/api`；挂载到 `/agents` 这类路径下的方式已移除，发布中也不再带 "
"`web-agents` 镜像。请从控制平面的 `.env` 中删除 "
"`AGENT_WEB_BASE_PATH`、`AGENT_WEB_API_URL` 和 "
"`AGENT_DEPLOYMENT_SHA`（`deploy.sh` 会导出它部署的提交）。空的 `AGENT_WEB_BASE_PATH` "
"无害；设了值的会让 `deploy.sh` 和发布部署器停止。`AGENT_NETWORK_NAME` 也可以删除，除非另一套服务的反向代理以 "
"`cloud-agent` 以外的名称加入该网络。解析发布的发行版必须先能接受不含 `/agents` Web 镜像的发布，再去部署它。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:305
msgid "Four values moved into Admin:"
msgstr "四个值移入了 Admin："

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:307
msgid ""
"**Live streams per account** (`AGENT_MAX_STREAMS_PER_USER`) and **Serve "
"API documentation** (`AGENT_API_DOCS`), under Admin → Settings → "
"Operations, in its **Advanced** section, applied without a restart."
msgstr ""
"**Live streams per account**（`AGENT_MAX_STREAMS_PER_USER`）和 **Serve API "
"documentation**（`AGENT_API_DOCS`），位于 Admin → Settings → Operations 的 "
"**Advanced** 部分，无需重启即可生效。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:310
msgid ""
"**Agent package registry** (`AGENT_RUNTIME_REGISTRY_URL`), under Admin → "
"Settings → Agent versions. Hosts receive it on every heartbeat; until "
"every online host reports it, that tab names the hosts missing it and "
"agent updates stay disabled."
msgstr ""
"**Agent package registry**（`AGENT_RUNTIME_REGISTRY_URL`），位于 Admin → "
"Settings → Agent versions。主机在每次心跳时收到它；在每台在线主机都报告它之前，该标签页会列出缺少它的主机，agent "
"更新保持禁用。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:314
msgid ""
"**Turn lease** (`AGENT_LEASE_TTL`), for all servers or one, from the "
"admin pages. Each host imports its own value once, from its next "
"heartbeat."
msgstr ""
"**Turn "
"lease**（`AGENT_LEASE_TTL`），可在管理页面中为所有服务器或单台服务器设置。每台主机从下一次心跳起导入一次自己的值。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:317
msgid ""
"A deployment that skipped the releases where these settings were added "
"still imports an old value once."
msgstr "跳过了添加这些设置的版本的部署，仍会把旧值导入一次。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:320
msgid "Independent accounts cutover"
msgstr "独立账号切换"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:322
msgid ""
"This release removes HybridInference Gateway sign-in, admission and "
"inference. Cloud Agent keeps its own accounts, and every task runs on a "
"model connection its owner adds with their own provider key. An earlier "
"database is keyed by Gateway owner IDs that no account holds, so it is "
"not upgraded, converted or mapped: the release starts on a **new, empty "
"database**, and the old one stays untouched as the archive and rollback "
"source. People register again, apply through the waiting list and add "
"their model connections; nothing migrates old tasks, connections or "
"identities."
msgstr ""
"本版本移除了 HybridInference Gateway 的登录、准入和推理。Cloud Agent "
"保留自己的账号，每个任务都运行在所有者用自己的服务商密钥添加的模型连接上。旧数据库以 Gateway 的所有者 ID 为键，而这些 ID "
"不属于任何账号，所以它不会被升级、转换或映射：本版本从一个**新的空数据库**开始，旧数据库原封不动，作为归档和回滚来源。用户需要重新注册、通过等候名单申请并添加模型连接；旧的任务、连接和身份都不会迁移。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:331
msgid ""
"**Archive the old deployment.** Drain it, stop every writer, and take a "
"custom-format `pg_dump` of the old Agent database with its checksum, the "
"old configuration and the root keys. Keep the old database; do not "
"delete, downgrade or rebind it. To confirm, read-only, that this release "
"refuses it:"
msgstr ""
"**归档旧部署**。排空它，停止所有写入方，用 custom 格式对旧 Agent 数据库做 `pg_dump` "
"并记录校验和，同时保存旧配置和根密钥。保留旧数据库；不要删除、降级或重新绑定它。如需以只读方式确认本版本会拒绝它："

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:341
msgid "It exits non-zero, names this runbook, and changes nothing."
msgstr "它以非零状态退出，指出本操作手册，并且不做任何改动。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:343
msgid ""
"**Create a new, empty Agent database** and point `AGENT_DATABASE_URL` at "
"it. On the bundled `postgres` service, also set `AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` to "
"its name, or the healthcheck, pgAdmin and the documented backup stay on "
"the archive ([why](#the-bundled-database-is-the-one-agent_postgres_db-"
"names)). The same check must now report an empty database that will be "
"bound on first start; `deploy/control-plane/deploy.sh` runs it read-only "
"before it migrates, and stops if it refuses."
msgstr ""
"**新建一个空的 Agent 数据库**，并把 `AGENT_DATABASE_URL` 指向它。使用内置 `postgres` 服务时，还要把 "
"`AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` 设为它的名称，否则健康检查、pgAdmin 和文档中的备份仍会指向归档库（[原因](#the-"
"bundled-database-is-the-one-agent_postgres_db-"
"names)）。这时同一项检查必须报告一个将在首次启动时绑定的空数据库；`deploy/control-plane/deploy.sh` "
"会在迁移前以只读方式运行它，检查拒绝时就停止。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:351
msgid ""
"**Give the deployment its own secrets**, shared with neither the Gateway "
"nor another environment: `AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`, "
"`AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY`, `AGENT_CONTROL_TOKEN_SECRET` and "
"`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY` (each at least 32 random bytes, "
"`openssl rand -hex 32`), and a separate `ADMIN_TOKEN`. Hosts enroll again"
" with new enrollment tokens."
msgstr ""
"**为部署设置自己的密钥**，不与 Gateway "
"或其他环境共享：`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`、`AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY`、`AGENT_CONTROL_TOKEN_SECRET`"
" 和 `AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY`（每个至少 32 个随机字节，可用 `openssl rand "
"-hex 32` 生成），以及单独的 `ADMIN_TOKEN`。主机需要用新的注册令牌重新注册。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:358
msgid ""
"**Remove every Gateway variable.** The control plane and `deploy.sh` "
"refuse `AGENT_AUTH_MODE`, `GATEWAY_*` (issuer, JWKS, authorize, base URL,"
" grant path, binding and dispatch token), `IDENTITY_*`, "
"`AGENT_SESSION_REDIRECT_URI`, `AGENT_GATEWAY_URL`, "
"`AGENT_GATEWAY_SSH_HOST`, `AGENT_WEB_GATEWAY_URL`, "
"`AGENT_WEB_FEATURE_RAG` and the on-call dispatch variables; a host "
"refuses `AGENT_GATEWAY_URL`, `AGENT_GATEWAY_HOSTNAME` and the inference "
"tunnel's `AGENT_TUNNEL_*`. Set `AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL`, the base of every "
"emailed link, and `AGENT_PUBLIC_API_URL`, this API's public address, "
"which `AGENT_SESSION_REDIRECT_URI` used to give."
msgstr ""
"**删除所有 Gateway 变量**。控制平面和 `deploy.sh` 会拒绝 "
"`AGENT_AUTH_MODE`、`GATEWAY_*`（issuer、JWKS、authorize、base URL、grant "
"路径、binding 和 dispatch "
"令牌）、`IDENTITY_*`、`AGENT_SESSION_REDIRECT_URI`、`AGENT_GATEWAY_URL`、`AGENT_GATEWAY_SSH_HOST`、`AGENT_WEB_GATEWAY_URL`、`AGENT_WEB_FEATURE_RAG`"
" 和值班分发相关变量；主机会拒绝 `AGENT_GATEWAY_URL`、`AGENT_GATEWAY_HOSTNAME` 以及推理隧道的 "
"`AGENT_TUNNEL_*`。设置 `AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL`（所有邮件链接的基础地址）和 "
"`AGENT_PUBLIC_API_URL`（本 API 的公开地址，以前由 `AGENT_SESSION_REDIRECT_URI` 提供）。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:369
msgid ""
"**Mail.** An existing SMTP transport, such as HybridInference's, may be "
"reused: set `AGENT_SMTP_HOST`, `AGENT_SMTP_PORT` (587), "
"`AGENT_SMTP_SECURITY=starttls`, `AGENT_SMTP_USERNAME`, "
"`AGENT_SMTP_PASSWORD` and `AGENT_SMTP_FROM` from the operator's secret "
"store, never from the repository. Only the transport is shared: links are"
" built from `AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL` and signed with this deployment's own "
"`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`, and the account data is this database's."
msgstr ""
"**邮件**。可以复用已有的 SMTP 通道，例如 HybridInference 的：从运维人员的密钥存储中（绝不从仓库中）设置 "
"`AGENT_SMTP_HOST`、`AGENT_SMTP_PORT`（587）、`AGENT_SMTP_SECURITY=starttls`、`AGENT_SMTP_USERNAME`、`AGENT_SMTP_PASSWORD`"
" 和 `AGENT_SMTP_FROM`。共享的只有发送通道：链接以 `AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL` 构建，用本部署自己的 "
"`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET` 签名，账号数据属于本数据库。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:377
msgid ""
"**Initial administrators.** List the verified addresses of the people who"
" administer the deployment in `AGENT_LOCAL_ADMIN_EMAILS` (`admin-"
"one@example.org,admin-two@example.org` are placeholders). Like every "
"account setting, the list is imported once, at the first start, and "
"edited under **Admin → Settings → Accounts** afterwards. A listed account"
" becomes an administrator only once a link sent to its address proves it,"
" and the first person to sign up gets nothing. For the very first "
"administrator you can instead exchange the setup code the control plane "
"logs (`agent_local_setup_pending`) at `/setup/administrator`, or use "
"`python -m cloud_agent.accounts.bootstrap_admin` ([first administrator"
"](local-accounts.md#the-first-administrator))."
msgstr ""
"**初始管理员**。在 `AGENT_LOCAL_ADMIN_EMAILS` 中列出管理本部署的人员的已验证邮箱（`admin-"
"one@example.org,admin-two@example.org` "
"只是占位符）。与所有账号设置一样，这个名单只在首次启动时导入一次，之后在 **Admin → Settings → Accounts** "
"中编辑。名单中的账号只有在发到其地址的链接证明了地址归属后才会成为管理员，第一个注册的人什么也得不到。对于第一个管理员，你也可以在 "
"`/setup/administrator` 用控制平面记录的设置码（`agent_local_setup_pending`）换取，或者使用 "
"`python -m cloud_agent.accounts.bootstrap_admin`（[第一个管理员](local-"
"accounts.md#the-first-administrator)）。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:389
msgid ""
"**Deploy and verify.** Run the usual deployment, then check that sign-up "
"sends a verification link at `AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL`, that an administrator "
"can approve an application, and that the applicant can add a model "
"connection and run a task. Model connections are on by default; to hold "
"new turns until every host and control-plane replica runs this release, "
"set `AGENT_MODEL_CONNECTIONS_ENABLED=false` before deploying and unset it"
" once they all do."
msgstr ""
"**部署并验证**。照常部署，然后检查：注册时会发出指向 `AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL` "
"的验证链接；管理员能够批准申请；申请人能够添加模型连接并运行任务。模型连接默认开启；如果要等每台主机和每个控制平面副本都运行本版本后再允许新轮次，请在部署前设置"
" `AGENT_MODEL_CONNECTIONS_ENABLED=false`，全部升级后再取消。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:397
msgid ""
"**Rollback.** Before the new deployment takes writes that matter, stop it"
" and redeploy the previous release against the archived database and "
"configuration, which never changed. After that, keep the new database: "
"the old release cannot read its accounts, and the two databases are never"
" merged."
msgstr "**回滚**。在新部署写入重要数据之前，可以停止它，用从未改动过的归档数据库和配置重新部署上一版本。在那之后，请保留新数据库：旧版本读不了它的账号，两个数据库也永远不会合并。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:402
msgid "Conversation history read contract"
msgstr "对话历史读取协议"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:404
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/agent/jobs/{job_id}/thread` now answers with `history_version: "
"2`; deploy the frontend with the API. The message and job arrays keep "
"their chronological order but are a bounded page: at most 50 turn and "
"message entries by default, `limit` up to 100, and at most 512 KiB "
"serialized. Small histories stay complete. `current_job_id` names the "
"newest turn whatever the page, and `anchor=true` starts the page at the "
"selected job."
msgstr ""
"`GET /v1/agent/jobs/{job_id}/thread` 现在返回 `history_version: 2`；请把前端和 API "
"一起部署。消息和任务数组保持时间顺序，但只是有界的一页：默认最多 50 个轮次和消息条目，`limit` 最大 100，序列化后最多 512 "
"KiB。较短的历史仍然完整。不管当前是哪一页，`current_job_id` 都指向最新的轮次；`anchor=true` "
"让这一页从所选任务开始。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:411
msgid ""
"Pass `next_cursor` as `cursor` to load older history. To refresh, keep "
"older pages, pass `sync_cursor` as `after`, then pass each returned "
"`next_cursor` as `after` until it is null. This rereads the two mutable "
"tail turns, so an in-flight write cannot hide behind a newly allocated "
"ID. Merge messages by ID and jobs by ID and revision, keeping turn order "
"with each opening prompt before its replies and mid-turn messages. Every "
"request checks the cursor against the owner's undeleted conversation."
msgstr ""
"把 `next_cursor` 作为 `cursor` 传入可以加载更早的历史。刷新时保留已加载的较早页面，把 `sync_cursor` 作为 "
"`after` 传入，再把每次返回的 `next_cursor` 作为 `after` 传入，直到它为 "
"null。这样会重新读取末尾两个仍可能变化的轮次，正在写入的内容不会藏到新分配的 ID 后面。按 ID 合并消息，按 ID "
"和版本合并任务，保持轮次顺序，并让每轮的开场提示排在其回复和轮中消息之前。每个请求都会针对所有者未删除的对话检查游标。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:419
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A message longer than 4,096 Unicode characters carries "
"`content_truncated` and `next_offset`. Read the rest through `GET "
"/v1/agent/jobs/{job_id}/thread/messages/{message_id}?offset=...`, at most"
" 16,384 characters per request, with offsets in Unicode characters rather"
" than UTF-8 bytes or JavaScript UTF-16 units. `thread_preview` marks a "
"job whose wide fields need the single-job detail read. A false "
"`pending_messages_complete` means read the queue from `GET "
"/v1/agent/threads/{thread_id}/messages`; an omitted queue snapshot is not"
" an empty queue. Only the owner-facing read API changes, not runtime "
"session recovery or transcript replay."
msgstr ""
"超过 4,096 个 Unicode 字符的消息带有 `content_truncated` 和 `next_offset`。其余部分通过 "
"`GET /v1/agent/jobs/{job_id}/thread/messages/{message_id}?offset=...` "
"读取，每次最多 16,384 个字符，偏移量按 Unicode 字符计，而不是 UTF-8 字节或 JavaScript 的 UTF-16 "
"码元。`thread_preview` 标记需要通过单个任务详情读取宽字段的任务。`pending_messages_complete` 为 "
"false 时，要从 `GET /v1/agent/threads/{thread_id}/messages` "
"读取队列；省略的队列快照不等于空队列。变化的只是面向所有者的读取 API，与运行时会话恢复或对话记录重放无关。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:429
msgid "Recent migrations"
msgstr "近期迁移"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:431
msgid "Newest first."
msgstr "新的排在前面。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "Migration"
msgstr "迁移"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "What it changes"
msgstr "改了什么"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0120_operator_model_budgets`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Prices provided models by cost instead of counting requests. Adds "
"`user_daily_budget_microusd` to `agent_operator_model_connections`; four "
"prices and `named_only` to `agent_operator_model_limits`; the tables "
"`agent_operator_user_budgets` (an account's own daily budget) and "
"`agent_operator_model_user_access` (an account's own answer on a model); "
"and to `agent_operator_model_usage` the cost, tokens and estimated-"
"request count of what it counts. Only additions: `user_daily_requests` "
"and `agent_operator_model_user_limits` stay, unread. A request limit of "
"`0` becomes a model for named accounts only, and an account's own limit "
"becomes its answer (`0` withheld, otherwise offered); no budget or price "
"is derived from a request count. The previous release keeps enforcing its"
" request limits, and a model first priced by this release gets a limit of"
" `0`, which that release reads as offered to nobody. A downgrade drops "
"the additions ([A deployment can provide models](#a-deployment-can-"
"provide-models))."
msgstr ""
"按费用而不是请求数为部署提供的模型计费。为 `agent_operator_model_connections` 添加 "
"`user_daily_budget_microusd`；为 `agent_operator_model_limits` 添加四个价格和 "
"`named_only`；新增表 `agent_operator_user_budgets`（单个账号自己的每日预算）和 "
"`agent_operator_model_user_access`（单个账号对某个模型的单独答复）；并为 "
"`agent_operator_model_usage` 添加所统计请求的费用、token "
"数和按估算计费的请求数。只有新增：`user_daily_requests` 和 "
"`agent_operator_model_user_limits` 保留但不再读取。请求上限为 `0` "
"的模型变为仅限指定账号，每个账号自己的上限变为它的答复（`0` "
"为不提供，其他为提供）；不会从请求数推导出任何预算或价格。上一版本继续执行它读取的请求上限；本版本首次定价的模型会写入上限 "
"`0`，上一版本将其理解为默认不向任何人提供。降级会删除新增的内容（[部署可以提供模型](#a-deployment-can-provide-"
"models)）。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0119_drop_account_provisioning`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Drops `agent_account_provisioning` and "
"`agent_account_provisioning_activation`, with their rows, and removes the"
" four `accounts.inference_provisioning_*` stored settings, including the "
"dispatch token, moving the settings revision on by one if it removed any."
" The previous release runs beside it with provisioning off. A downgrade "
"recreates the tables empty and does not restore the settings ([Inference "
"provisioning is withdrawn](#inference-provisioning-is-withdrawn))."
msgstr ""
"删除 `agent_account_provisioning` 和 `agent_account_provisioning_activation`"
" 及其中的行，并从已存设置中移除四个 `accounts.inference_provisioning_*` "
"值（包括分发令牌），如有移除则把设置版本加一。上一版本在关闭预配的状态下与之并行运行。降级会重建这两张空表，但不恢复这些设置（[推理预配已撤回"
"](#inference-provisioning-is-withdrawn)）。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0118_operator_model_connections`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds the tables for provided models: `agent_operator_model_connections` "
"(endpoint, encrypted key, models and their verification), "
"`agent_operator_model_limits` (each model's default daily request "
"allowance and concurrency cap), `agent_operator_model_user_limits` (an "
"account's own allowance), `agent_operator_model_usage` (requests the "
"relay accepted per account, model and UTC day) and "
"`agent_operator_connection_residencies` (the revision a member's process "
"started on). A turn names a provided connection in the existing "
"`model_connection_id` columns. The previous release runs beside it. A "
"downgrade refuses while a provided connection exists or a turn or waiting"
" message names one."
msgstr ""
"添加部署提供模型所需的表：`agent_operator_model_connections`（端点、加密的密钥、模型及其验证结果）、`agent_operator_model_limits`（每个模型的默认每日请求额度和并发上限）、`agent_operator_model_user_limits`（单个账号自己的额度）、`agent_operator_model_usage`（中继按账号、模型和"
" UTC 日接受的请求数）和 "
"`agent_operator_connection_residencies`（成员进程启动时所用的版本）。轮次在现有的 "
"`model_connection_id` "
"列中引用部署提供的连接。上一版本可与之并行运行。只要存在部署提供的连接，或有轮次或等待中的消息引用它，降级就会拒绝。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0117_connection_model_limit`"
msgstr "`0117_connection_model_limit`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Raises `agent_model_connections_models_check` from eight model ids to "
"sixteen, under the same name and its table lock; no row is rewritten. The"
" previous release runs beside it: it refuses a seventeenth id itself, and"
" the wider check accepts what it stored. A downgrade restores the eight-"
"model check and fails while a connection lists more than eight."
msgstr ""
"把 `agent_model_connections_models_check` 的模型 ID 上限从 8 个提高到 16 "
"个，约束名不变，先取得表锁；不重写任何行。上一版本可与之并行运行：它自己会拒绝第十七个 ID，放宽后的检查也接受它存下的内容。降级会恢复 8 "
"个模型的检查，只要有连接列出超过 8 个模型就会失败。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0116_account_provisioning`"
msgstr "`0116_account_provisioning`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds `agent_account_provisioning` (one invitation row per account for the"
" connected inference service) and `agent_account_provisioning_activation`"
" (when provisioning was first enabled, so only later approvals are "
"invited). Nothing read them before, so the previous release runs "
"unchanged beside it. A downgrade drops both."
msgstr ""
"添加 `agent_account_provisioning`（每个账号一行，记录所连接推理服务的邀请状态）和 "
"`agent_account_provisioning_activation`（首次启用预配的时间，只有之后的批准才会被邀请）。此前没有代码读取它们，所以上一版本可以不受影响地并行运行。降级会删除这两张表。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0115_mcp_retire_dead_locations`"
msgstr "`0115_mcp_retire_dead_locations`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Moves every MCP connection at `managed-worker` or `user-connector` to "
"`sandbox`, keeping its launch, credentials and connector link; moves its "
"`config_revision` and `authorization_epoch` on by one, as a location edit"
" does; and turns an `error` status into `draft`. Then narrows "
"`agent_mcp_connections_location_check` to `remote` and `sandbox` under "
"the table lock it already holds. No row is deleted. The previous release "
"runs beside it, except that its writes of a removed location are refused."
" A downgrade restores the four-location check; moved rows stay `sandbox` "
"([MCP servers run in two places](#mcp-servers-run-in-two-places))."
msgstr ""
"把存储在 `managed-worker` 或 `user-connector` 的每个 MCP 连接移到 "
"`sandbox`，保留其启动方式、凭据和连接器关联；像编辑位置一样把 `config_revision` 和 "
"`authorization_epoch` 加一；并把 `error` 状态改为 `draft`。随后在已持有的表锁下把 "
"`agent_mcp_connections_location_check` 收窄为 `remote` 和 "
"`sandbox`。不删除任何行。上一版本可以并行运行，只是它写入已移除位置会被拒绝。降级会恢复四个位置的检查；移动过的行保持 "
"`sandbox`（[MCP 服务器只在两处运行](#mcp-servers-run-in-two-places)）。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0114_admin_audit_attribution`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds attribution to `agent_admin_audit_log`: `actor_type`, generated from"
" `actor_id`, and `actor_label`, `target_type`, `target_id`, "
"`target_label`, `subject_label`, `outcome`, `reason` and "
"`correlation_id`, backfilled from each row's action and details and the "
"current account names; and the tables `agent_admin_audit_outcomes` (a "
"requested sandbox deletion's final result) and "
"`agent_admin_audit_write_failures`. It deletes the Servers page's polling"
" reads and connection checks, and collapses the sandbox deletion worker's"
" per-step rows into one result per request, keeping worker rows that name"
" no request. The generated column rewrites the table under a brief lock. "
"The previous release keeps using the original columns, and its rows are "
"classified by the generated column. A downgrade drops the columns and "
"tables; deleted rows are not restored, and the deletion steps remain in "
"`agent_sandbox_events`."
msgstr ""
"为 `agent_admin_audit_log` 添加归属信息：由 `actor_id` 生成的 `actor_type`，以及 "
"`actor_label`、`target_type`、`target_id`、`target_label`、`subject_label`、`outcome`、`reason`"
" 和 `correlation_id`，根据各行的操作、详情和当前账号名称回填；并添加两张表 "
"`agent_admin_audit_outcomes`（所请求的沙箱删除的最终结果）和 "
"`agent_admin_audit_write_failures`。它删除 Servers 页面的轮询读取和连接检查记录，并把沙箱删除 "
"worker 的逐步记录合并为每个请求一条结果，不对应任何请求的 worker "
"记录会保留。添加生成列会在短暂的锁下重写整张表。上一版本继续读写原有的列，它写入的行由生成列归类。降级会删除这些列和表；已删除的行不会恢复，删除步骤仍保存在"
" `agent_sandbox_events` 中。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0113_sandbox_incidents`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Makes sandbox incidents idempotent and tracks what each chat's agent was "
"told: a unique index on `agent_sandbox_events (sandbox_id, "
"details->>'incident_id')` for `incident.*` rows, and the tables "
"`agent_thread_incident_cursors` and `agent_attempt_incident_marks`. A "
"trigger on `agent_thread_sandbox_memberships` starts a chat's cursor when"
" it joins or moves sandbox, and every existing membership gets one. The "
"previous release runs unchanged beside it. A downgrade drops the "
"triggers, tables and index; incident rows stay."
msgstr ""
"让沙箱事件幂等，并记录每个对话的 agent 已被告知的内容：为 `incident.*` 行在 `agent_sandbox_events "
"(sandbox_id, details->>'incident_id')` 上建唯一索引，并新增 "
"`agent_thread_incident_cursors` 和 `agent_attempt_incident_marks` "
"两张表。`agent_thread_sandbox_memberships` "
"上的触发器会在对话加入或更换沙箱时为它建立游标，现有的每个成员关系也会得到一个。上一版本可以不受影响地并行运行。降级会删除触发器、表和索引；事件行保留。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0112_thread_pull_requests`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds `agent_thread_pull_requests`, the pull requests a conversation's "
"agent opened through the GitHub relay, one row per conversation and pull "
"request. The previous release runs unchanged beside it. A downgrade drops"
" the table."
msgstr ""
"添加 `agent_thread_pull_requests`：对话的 agent 通过 GitHub "
"中继开出的拉取请求，每个对话和拉取请求一行。上一版本可以不受影响地并行运行。降级会删除这张表。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0111_mcp_sandbox_location`"
msgstr "`0111_mcp_sandbox_location`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Lets an MCP connection run in the task sandbox: "
"`agent_mcp_connections_location_check` admits `sandbox` beside `remote`, "
"`managed-worker` and `user-connector`. No row changes. A downgrade "
"restores the three-location check, and refuses while a sandbox connection"
" exists."
msgstr ""
"允许 MCP 连接在任务沙箱中运行：`agent_mcp_connections_location_check` 在 `remote"
"`、`managed-worker` 和 `user-connector` 之外接受 "
"`sandbox`。不改动任何行。降级会恢复三个位置的检查，存在沙箱连接时则拒绝。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0110_host_late_settings`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds two columns to `agent_runner_hosts`: the host settings registered "
"after a host's first import that it has already offered (so each is "
"imported once, and an administrator's reset is never undone), and what "
"the host reports it uses for configuration delivered on the heartbeat, "
"such as the agent package registry. A downgrade drops both."
msgstr ""
"为 `agent_runner_hosts` "
"添加两列：主机首次导入之后才注册、且该主机已提供过的主机设置（这样每项只导入一次，管理员的重置也不会被撤销），以及主机报告的、通过心跳下发的配置（例如"
" agent 包仓库）的实际使用情况。降级会删除这两列。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0109_local_account_parity`"
msgstr "`0109_local_account_parity`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Accounts only. Splits `agent_local_password_logins` into sign-in "
"identities (email, login name, phone) and optional password credentials, "
"carrying every account over with its verification time and hash (a "
"verified email is recorded as verified by link); adds the access view "
"every SQL gate reads, the `deleted` state with the account's name, note, "
"language and sign-in and deletion times, phone codes, browser sessions, "
"sign-in events, the signup domain list, first-run setup and mail to "
"accounts. A downgrade restores the email-and-password table and drops the"
" new tables, with their sign-in events and mail history; it refuses while"
" an account signs in another way or is deleted."
msgstr ""
"只涉及账号。把 `agent_local_password_logins` "
"拆分为登录标识（邮箱、登录名、手机号）和可选的密码凭据，迁移每个账号及其验证时间和哈希（已验证的邮箱记为通过链接验证）；添加每个 SQL "
"门禁读取的访问视图、带账号名称、备注、语言以及登录和删除时间的 `deleted` "
"状态、短信验证码、浏览器会话、登录事件、注册域名列表、首次运行设置和群发邮件。降级会恢复邮箱加密码的表，并删除新表及其中的登录事件和邮件历史；只要有账号以其他方式登录或已被删除，降级就会拒绝。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0108_local_accounts`"
msgstr "`0108_local_accounts`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Creates the account tables: accounts, password sign-in, waiting-list "
"admissions, server-side sessions, emailed tokens, abuse counters, access "
"terminations and the identity marker. It changes no existing row and "
"locks no existing table. A downgrade drops them, and every account with "
"them."
msgstr "创建账号相关的表：账号、密码登录、等候名单准入、服务端会话、邮件令牌、防滥用计数器、访问终止记录和身份标记。它不改动任何现有行，也不锁任何现有表。降级会删除这些表，所有账号随之删除。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0107_attempt_context_profiles`"
msgstr "`0107_attempt_context_profiles`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds `agent_attempt_context_profiles`, a rebuildable cache of each "
"attempt's context profile behind the Context view and the Usage page's "
"context insights. It scans and rewrites nothing: profiles are derived "
"when an owner reads them, and a stale row is rebuilt from the event "
"ledger. A downgrade drops the cache."
msgstr ""
"添加 `agent_attempt_context_profiles`，这是每个 attempt 上下文概况的可重建缓存，供 Context "
"视图和 Usage 页面的上下文分析使用。它不扫描也不重写任何东西：概况在所有者读取时推算，过期的行会根据事件账本重建。降级只删除这个缓存。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0106_user_model_connections`"
msgstr "`0106_user_model_connections`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds `agent_model_connections`, `agent_model_connection_checks` and "
"`agent_model_connection_scan_keys` for owners' own inference endpoints; "
"the nullable source columns `agent_jobs.model_connection_id` and "
"`agent_pending_messages.model_connection_id`; and "
"`agent_model_connection_residencies`, binding a resident member's process"
" to one connection revision (a separate table, so the previous release's "
"prepared statements on memberships keep working). Nothing is rewritten. "
"Connections are on unless `AGENT_MODEL_CONNECTIONS_ENABLED` is `0`, "
"`false` or `no`. A downgrade refuses while any connection exists, or any "
"turn, waiting message or resident member names one ([owner model "
"connections](operations.md#owner-model-connections))."
msgstr ""
"为所有者自己的推理端点添加 `agent_model_connections`、`agent_model_connection_checks` 和"
" `agent_model_connection_scan_keys`；添加可为空的来源列 "
"`agent_jobs.model_connection_id` 和 "
"`agent_pending_messages.model_connection_id`；以及 "
"`agent_model_connection_residencies`，把常驻成员的进程绑定到一个连接版本（单独建表，这样上一版本在成员关系表上的预编译语句仍能工作）。不重写任何东西。除非"
" `AGENT_MODEL_CONNECTIONS_ENABLED` 设为 `0`、`false` 或 "
"`no`，否则连接默认开启。只要存在任何连接，或有轮次、等待中的消息或常驻成员引用连接，降级就会拒绝（[owner model "
"connections](operations.md#owner-model-connections)）。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0105_job_event_usage_summary`"
msgstr "`0105_job_event_usage_summary`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds a nullable `usage_summary` column to `agent_job_events`, holding its"
" lock only for the catalog change. New events store the projection usage "
"reads need; older events are projected when read. A downgrade drops the "
"column."
msgstr ""
"为 `agent_job_events` 添加可为空的 `usage_summary` "
"列，只在修改目录时持有锁。新事件保存用量读取所需的投影；更早的事件在读取时再投影。降级会删除这一列。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0104_notification_change_keyset`"
msgstr "`0104_notification_change_keyset`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Builds a `(user_id, kind, change_xid, entity_id)` index concurrently "
"before dropping the old owner/XID index, so notification delta pages seek"
" directly. No row changes, and foreground writes are not blocked. "
"Existing v1 continuations finish in their old order before moving to v2, "
"and the previous API keeps working, possibly on a less selective index. A"
" downgrade restores the old index concurrently."
msgstr ""
"先并发建立 `(user_id, kind, change_xid, entity_id)` 索引，再删除旧的所有者/XID "
"索引，让通知增量分页直接定位。不改动任何行，也不阻塞前台写入。现有的 v1 续读会先按旧顺序读完再切换到 v2；上一版本的 API "
"仍能工作，只是可能用到选择性较差的索引。降级会并发恢复旧索引。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0103_terminal_resume_keyset`"
msgstr "`0103_terminal_resume_keyset`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Rebuilds the partial terminal-resume index on `(updated_at, id)`, "
"matching the replay keyset. The online build blocks no writes and changes"
" no row. A downgrade restores the one-column index."
msgstr "在 `(updated_at, id)` 上重建部分终端恢复索引，与重放所用的键集一致。在线构建不阻塞写入，也不改动任何行。降级会恢复单列索引。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0102_admin_sandbox_marker_order`"
msgstr "`0102_admin_sandbox_marker_order`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Replaces 0097's membership trigger so it locks a membership's sandbox "
"group before marking the group changed, the order every write to the "
"group takes. Before, settling, abandoning, ending, releasing or reaping a"
" turn could deadlock with the admin terminal check or a workspace start, "
"and Postgres aborted one. Only the trigger function changes. A downgrade "
"restores the 0097 trigger."
msgstr ""
"替换 0097 "
"的成员关系触发器，让它在标记沙箱组已变更之前先锁住该组，这与所有写入组的操作取锁顺序一致。在此之前，结束、放弃、终止、释放或回收轮次可能与管理端的终端检查或工作区启动发生死锁，Postgres"
" 会中止其中一个。只有触发器函数改变。降级会恢复 0097 的触发器。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0101_notification_state_deltas`"
msgstr "`0101_notification_state_deltas`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds coalesced per-owner job and thread change markers, an active-job "
"index and a partial recent-terminal marker index. Notification clients "
"bootstrap from bounded keyset pages, then request bounded deltas; nothing"
" is backfilled. Markers expire after 24 hours, and stale cursors rebuild."
" The previous push stream stays available. A downgrade drops the derived "
"state and restores push-only triggers."
msgstr ""
"添加合并后的按所有者的任务和对话变更标记、一个活跃任务索引，以及最近终止状态标记的部分索引。通知客户端先从有界的键集分页初始化，再请求有界的增量；不回填任何历史。标记"
" 24 小时后过期，过期的游标会重建。原有的推送流仍然可用。降级会删除这些派生状态，恢复只推送的触发器。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0100_memory_archive_pages`"
msgstr "`0100_memory_archive_pages`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Builds partial owner/scope indexes for active memories and archive pages "
"concurrently. Memory rows are unchanged, an interrupted build can be "
"retried, and offline SQL builds them plainly. A downgrade drops the "
"indexes."
msgstr "并发建立活跃记忆和归档分页用的部分所有者/范围索引。记忆行不变，中断的构建可以重试，离线 SQL 则直接普通构建。降级会删除这些索引。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0099_thread_stats_rollups`"
msgstr "`0099_thread_stats_rollups`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds a derived, versioned per-attempt cache of owner thread statistics, "
"filled in bounded 1,000-row pages; unchanged reads reuse it without "
"reading old events. Event storage and the billing ledger are unchanged. A"
" downgrade drops the cache."
msgstr ""
"添加派生的、带版本的按 attempt 的所有者对话统计缓存，以每页最多 1,000 "
"行的方式填充；内容未变时直接复用缓存，不读取旧事件。事件存储和计费账本不变。降级会删除这个缓存。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0098_measurement_counts`"
msgstr "`0098_measurement_counts`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Backfills exact profiling counts into at most 64 counter shards per run "
"and installs accounting triggers. The backfill holds a write-conflicting "
"lock on measurements until commit, so schedule a write pause sized to the"
" retained history. Raw samples and run summaries are unchanged. A "
"downgrade removes the counters and triggers."
msgstr ""
"把精确的性能分析计数回填到每次运行最多 64 个计数分片中，并安装计数触发器。回填期间会对 measurements "
"持有与写入冲突的锁，直到提交，所以请按保留的历史量安排一段停写时间。原始样本和运行汇总不变。降级会删除计数器和触发器。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0097_admin_sandbox_deltas`"
msgstr "`0097_admin_sandbox_deltas`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds coalesced metadata-change markers and short-lived, content-free "
"admin inventory snapshot pages, so admin refreshes fetch only changed "
"rows after the first snapshot; expired cursors resynchronize. Triggers "
"cover sandboxes, membership counts, origin titles and host heartbeats "
"without a fleet-wide lock. Deploy the migration before enabling the new "
"UI; older list clients keep working. A downgrade drops the derived state "
"and triggers."
msgstr "添加合并后的元数据变更标记和短期、不含内容的管理端资源清单快照分页，让管理端刷新时在首个快照之后只获取变化的行；过期的游标会重新同步。触发器覆盖沙箱、成员数量、来源标题和主机心跳，不需要全局写锁。请先部署迁移再启用新界面；旧的列表客户端仍可使用。降级会删除派生状态和触发器。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0096_snapshot_title_context`"
msgstr "`0096_snapshot_title_context`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds a bounded JSON title context to sandbox snapshots, so a publisher "
"claim never rebuilds or transfers the whole transcript. Each capture "
"continues from the newest earlier snapshot of its group that has one. "
"Existing snapshots start empty, and one still empty when claimed gets its"
" context built then, from at most 24 earlier snapshots and the newest 24 "
"turns. A downgrade drops the context."
msgstr ""
"为沙箱快照添加有界的 JSON "
"标题上下文，让发布器认领时不必重建或传输整个对话记录。每次捕获都接着同组最近一个有上下文的快照继续。已有快照初始为空，认领时仍为空的快照会在那时构建上下文，最多参考之前"
" 24 个快照和最新的 24 个轮次。降级会删除这个上下文。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0095_memory_retention`"
msgstr "`0095_memory_retention`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Builds partial archived-time and non-null superseded-by indexes "
"concurrently, without changing memory rows or the 90-day retention. An "
"interrupted build can be retried, and offline SQL builds them plainly. A "
"downgrade drops the indexes."
msgstr ""
"并发建立归档时间和非空 superseded-by 的部分索引，不改变记忆行或 90 天的保留策略。中断的构建可以重试，离线 SQL "
"则直接普通构建。降级会删除这些索引。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0094_thread_message_pages`"
msgstr "`0094_thread_message_pages`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Builds a concurrent index on each job's messages in prompt-first order, "
"so history pages read a bounded set of message IDs before the bodies. No "
"row changes. An interrupted online build is dropped and retried; offline "
"conversion builds it plainly. A downgrade drops it concurrently."
msgstr ""
"按提示在前的顺序为每个任务的消息并发建立索引，让历史分页先读取有限的消息 ID "
"再读正文。不改动任何行。中断的在线构建会被删除并重试；离线转换则直接普通构建。降级会并发删除该索引。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0093_recent_requests`"
msgstr "`0093_recent_requests`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds an owner/time-indexed projection of recent requests with maintenance"
" triggers, backfilled once. The trigger installation holds write-"
"conflicting locks during the backfill, so schedule a low-write period on "
"a large history. Source messages are unchanged. A downgrade removes the "
"projection and triggers."
msgstr "添加按所有者和时间索引的最近请求投影及维护触发器，并一次性回填。安装触发器时，回填期间会持有与写入冲突的锁，所以历史很大时请安排在写入较少的时段。源消息不变。降级会删除投影和触发器。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0092_targeted_work_wakes`"
msgstr "`0092_targeted_work_wakes`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Replaces the `agent_work_available` trigger function so its notification "
"names the one host that can take a retained conversation's turn, and only"
" that host's runner wakes. No table or row changes; a control plane on "
"the previous release ignores the name and wakes every host. A downgrade "
"restores the empty notification."
msgstr ""
"替换 `agent_work_available` 触发器函数，让通知指明能处理某个保留对话轮次的那一台主机，只唤醒那台主机的 "
"runner。不改动任何表或行；上一版本的控制平面会忽略这个名称，照旧唤醒所有主机。降级会恢复空通知。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0091_env_queued_runs_index`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Builds a partial index on `agent_environment_runs` concurrently, holding "
"only the runs queued for a host to claim; without it, every claim read "
"the whole test and prebuild history. It does not block inserts. An "
"interrupted build leaves an invalid index that the next run rebuilds, and"
" offline SQL builds it plainly. No row changes. A downgrade drops it "
"concurrently; claimed runs stay claimed."
msgstr ""
"在 `agent_environment_runs` "
"上并发建立部分索引，只包含等待主机认领的运行；没有它时，每次认领都要读取全部测试和预构建历史。它不阻塞插入。中断的构建会留下无效索引，下次运行时重建；离线"
" SQL 则直接普通构建。不改动任何行。降级会并发删除该索引；已认领的运行保持认领。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0090_user_model_preferences`"
msgstr "`0090_user_model_preferences`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds an empty table for each owner's pinned default model for new tasks. "
"Owners without a pin keep following their last task's model. A downgrade "
"drops the pins."
msgstr "添加一张空表，保存每个所有者为新任务固定的默认模型。没有固定的所有者继续沿用上一个任务的模型。降级只删除这些固定设置。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0089_superseded_removals`"
msgstr "`0089_superseded_removals`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds an empty table recording each authorization to remove a container "
"that a moved sandbox group left on a host being released, and when the "
"host confirmed the removal. A downgrade drops the records; removed "
"containers stay removed."
msgstr "添加一张空表，记录对搬迁后的沙箱组在待释放主机上留下的容器所做的每次删除授权，以及主机确认删除的时间。降级会删除这些记录；已删除的容器保持删除。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0088_sandbox_retry_budget`"
msgstr "`0088_sandbox_retry_budget`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds the automatic deletion retry window and attempt count. Pending "
"requests start their 24-hour window at their request time, and retries "
"stop after eight claims with bounded backoff. An administrator resumes an"
" archived terminal request under its request ID and verified receipt; a "
"terminal prearchive request is replaced through the authorized deletion "
"path, which gives the host a new archive identity."
msgstr ""
"添加自动删除的重试窗口和尝试次数。待处理的请求从请求时间开始计算 24 小时窗口，认领八次后停止重试，并采用有上限的退避。管理员可以在原请求 ID"
" 和已验证回执下恢复已归档的终止请求；终止的预归档请求会通过授权的删除路径替换，让主机获得新的归档标识。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0087_sandbox_deletion_attempts`"
msgstr "`0087_sandbox_deletion_attempts`"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "Adds the admin-only, secret-free attempt history of sandbox deletion."
msgstr "添加仅管理员可见、不含密钥的沙箱删除尝试历史。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0086_conversation_read_receipts`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds an empty table for each owner's latest read per conversation, with "
"indexes for incremental polling and foreign-key cleanup, taking brief "
"foreign-key locks on the referenced tables. A browser's own receipts are "
"imported when it next opens the app. A downgrade drops the stored "
"receipts; browser caches stay."
msgstr "添加一张空表，保存每个所有者在每个对话中最近一次已读，带有用于增量轮询和外键清理的索引，并对被引用的表短暂取得外键锁。浏览器本地的已读记录会在该浏览器下次打开应用时导入。降级会删除已保存的已读记录；浏览器缓存保留。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0085_terminal_resume_index`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Builds a partial index on `agent_jobs` concurrently, holding only the "
"turns whose terminals wait to resume. It does not block the API, and an "
"interrupted run can be repeated. No row changes."
msgstr "在 `agent_jobs` 上并发建立部分索引，只包含终端仍在等待恢复的轮次。它不阻塞 API，中断后可以直接重试。不改动任何行。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0084_host_removal_move_out`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds `agent_runner_hosts.removal_moves_out` and `removal_leaves_unmoved`,"
" false for existing hosts, so a pending removal keeps its earlier "
"meaning: revoke once its running turns end."
msgstr ""
"添加 `agent_runner_hosts.removal_moves_out` 和 "
"`removal_leaves_unmoved`，现有主机都为 false，这样已在等待的移除保持原有含义：其运行中的轮次结束后撤销。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0083_host_move_out`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds the `move_out` purpose to the admission-hold check. No row changes. "
"A downgrade deletes move-out holds; groups already moved keep their "
"checkpoints."
msgstr "在准入暂停的检查约束中添加 `move_out` 用途。不改动任何行。降级会删除迁出暂停；已迁出的组保留其检查点。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0082_team_environments`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds nullable team columns to environments and their bindings, and lets a"
" repository default name any environment. No row changes. A downgrade "
"refuses while a team environment exists, archived ones included."
msgstr "为环境及其绑定添加可为空的团队列，并允许仓库默认值指向任何环境。不改动任何行。只要存在团队环境（包括已归档的），降级就会拒绝。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0081_snapshot_pushed_commit`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds `agent_sandbox_snapshots.pushed_commit_sha` and copies into it the "
"commit of every never-published snapshot. `published_commit_sha` is "
"unchanged, so the API it replaces keeps working, and no notice fires."
msgstr ""
"添加 "
"`agent_sandbox_snapshots.pushed_commit_sha`，并把每个从未发布的快照的提交复制进去。`published_commit_sha`"
" 保持不变，所以被替换的 API 仍能工作，也不会触发通知。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0080_user_ssh_servers`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds the owner SSH server tables ([SSH servers](operations.md#ssh-"
"servers)). No row changes."
msgstr "添加所有者 SSH 服务器相关的表（[SSH servers](operations.md#ssh-servers)）。不改动任何行。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0079_teams`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds teams: members, single-use invitations, join requests and the team "
"audit log. No row changes."
msgstr "添加团队：成员、一次性邀请、加入申请和团队审计日志。不改动任何行。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0078_environment_snapshots`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds environment installation snapshots, and the setup fingerprint on "
"environment bindings that decides which snapshot a workspace may start "
"from ([environment installation snapshots](operations.md#environment-"
"installation-snapshots))."
msgstr ""
"添加环境安装快照，以及环境绑定上决定工作区可以从哪个快照启动的设置指纹（[environment installation "
"snapshots](operations.md#environment-installation-snapshots)）。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0077_sandbox_usage_days`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds the per-day container usage table and an owner index on "
"`agent_sandboxes`, built without `CONCURRENTLY`; with one row per "
"retained container, the write lock is short."
msgstr ""
"添加按天的容器用量表，并在 `agent_sandboxes` 上建立所有者索引，构建时不使用 "
"`CONCURRENTLY`；由于每个保留容器只有一行，写锁时间很短。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0076_mcp_residency_fence`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds a nullable residency generation to MCP approval records; existing "
"approvals keep it empty."
msgstr "给 MCP 审批记录加上一个可为空的 residency 代次；已有的审批记录这一列为空。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0075_runtime_upgrades`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "Adds two empty JSON columns for agent updates from Admin → Settings."
msgstr "为通过 Admin → Settings 进行的 agent 更新添加两个空的 JSON 列。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0074_host_removal_pending`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds `agent_runner_hosts.removal_requested_at`, empty for existing hosts."
" A downgrade drops it and leaves a host that was waiting for removal "
"draining."
msgstr ""
"添加 "
"`agent_runner_hosts.removal_requested_at`，现有主机为空。降级会删除它，原本等待移除的主机保持排空状态。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0073_sandbox_restore`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds the `cold` and `restoring` sandbox states and the start fence that "
"binds a checkpoint to the run it ends ([restoring a removed host's "
"sandboxes](operations.md#restoring-a-removed-hosts-sandboxes)). Existing "
"checkpoints carry no fence and never move a group. A downgrade refuses "
"while a group is cold or restoring."
msgstr ""
"添加 `cold` 和 `restoring` 沙箱状态，以及把检查点绑定到其结束的那次运行的启动栅栏（[restoring a removed "
"host's sandboxes](operations.md#restoring-a-removed-hosts-"
"sandboxes)）。现有检查点不带栅栏，永远不会移动组。只要有组处于 cold 或 restoring 状态，降级就会拒绝。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0072_drop_old_memory_tables`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Drops the retired memory tables. A rollback to before `0070` finds them "
"empty, without the earlier portraits and preferences."
msgstr "删除已停用的记忆表。回滚到 `0070` 之前时，这些表会是空的，没有早期的画像和偏好。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0071_temporary_workspaces`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Drops `NOT NULL` from `agent_threads.repo` and "
"`agent_environment_bindings.repo`, so conversations can start without a "
"repository. A downgrade refuses while such a conversation exists."
msgstr ""
"去掉 `agent_threads.repo` 和 `agent_environment_bindings.repo` 的 `NOT "
"NULL`，让对话可以不带仓库开始。只要存在这样的对话，降级就会拒绝。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0070_memory_cutover`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Moves the memory switches and saved preferences onto the durable-memory "
"table."
msgstr "把记忆功能的开关和已保存的偏好，搬到持久记忆表里。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0069_agent_memories`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "Adds the durable-memory table."
msgstr "新增持久记忆表。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0067_failed_snapshot_wake`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "Only replaces a trigger function."
msgstr "只替换了一个触发器函数。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0066_admin_job_listing_index`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Builds an index on `agent_jobs` concurrently. On a long job history it "
"takes a while without blocking the API, and an interrupted run can be "
"repeated."
msgstr "在 `agent_jobs` 上并发建立索引。任务历史很长时需要一段时间，但不阻塞 API，中断后可以直接重试。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0051_host_drain_fence_epoch`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Backfills a non-null drain-fence epoch for every host, which the database"
" rotates whenever drain-relevant lifecycle, credential, placement or "
"ownership state changes. Once the V2 control plane is active, this "
"revision and the `AGENT_DEPLOY_DRAIN_FENCE_V2` recipe marker are the "
"application and schema rollback floor ([rollback "
"compatibility](operations.md#rollback-compatibility))."
msgstr ""
"为每台主机回填非空的排空栅栏 epoch，每当与排空相关的生命周期、凭据、放置或归属状态变化时，数据库都会轮换它。V2 "
"控制平面启用后，这个版本和配方中的 `AGENT_DEPLOY_DRAIN_FENCE_V2` 标记就是应用和 schema "
"回滚的下限（[rollback compatibility](operations.md#rollback-compatibility)）。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0049_host_drain_fence`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Starts every existing host with no deployment drain owner or release "
"receipt. Its V1 marker remains only so an older orchestrator can do the "
"bridge upgrade, and is not a rollback target after V2."
msgstr "让每台现有主机以没有部署排空所有者、也没有发布回执的状态开始。它引入的 V1 标记只是为了让旧的编排程序完成过渡升级，在 V2 启用后不是回滚目标。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0048_sandbox_plugins`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds `agent_threads.plugins`; existing chats have no plugins. Rebuild the"
" sandbox image so the CLI wrappers load selected plugins."
msgstr "添加 `agent_threads.plugins`；现有对话没有插件。请重新构建沙箱镜像，让 CLI 包装脚本加载所选插件。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid "`0046_job_claim_retry`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md
msgid ""
"Adds `agent_jobs.claim_retry_at`, which the claim query needs. Queued "
"jobs stay immediately eligible."
msgstr "添加 `agent_jobs.claim_retry_at`，认领查询需要它。排队中的任务仍可立即被认领。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:494
msgid ""
"Older revisions that need a maintenance window are listed in [applying "
"migrations that are not backwards-compatible](operations.md#applying-"
"migrations-that-are-not-backwards-compatible). A database from before the"
" independent-accounts release, on either chain, is not upgraded; see [the"
" cutover](#independent-accounts-cutover)."
msgstr ""
"需要维护窗口的较早修订列在[应用不向后兼容的迁移](operations.md#applying-migrations-that-are-not-"
"backwards-compatible)中。独立账号版本之前的数据库，无论处于哪条迁移链，都不会被升级；见[切换说明"
"](#independent-accounts-cutover)。"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:499
msgid "When you add a migration"
msgstr "新增迁移时"

#: ../developer/upgrade-notes.md:501
msgid ""
"Add a row to the table above in the same pull request, saying what an "
"operator upgrading a live deployment needs to know: which existing rows "
"it changes, how long it can lock, and whether its downgrade refuses. Then"
" update the head revision named under *Before starting this release* and "
"in [ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md); a test checks that both name "
"the current head."
msgstr ""
"在同一个拉取请求中给上表加一行，写明升级线上部署的运维人员需要知道的内容：它改动哪些现有行、可能锁多久、降级是否会拒绝。然后更新 *Before "
"starting this release* 一节和 [ENVIRONMENT.md](../../ENVIRONMENT.md) "
"中的最新版本号；有测试检查两处都写的是当前最新版本。"

